ates the same type of Disquiet as an Unfleshed.<br /> <br /> Whenever Radioheart regains Pyros, he can reflexively transfer any amount to Marconi, as long as the latter is within Radioheart\u2019s immediate vicinity and perceptible. When using Mortal Mask, Marconi does not assume the form of a mortal, he assumes the form of a normal dog. Without the Mortal Mask, he is obviously a robotic canine, but not overtly supernatural. Marconi does not heal Lethal or Aggravated Damage over time, and instead relies on the Digitalize Manifestation or Repairs [Intelligence + Crafts] with an effective Equipment Bonus equal to his Rank due to the significantly modular and streamlined nature of his supernatural hardware and software.<br /> <br /> The Repairs take 1 hour per -1 on the Repairs roll, and each -1 taken removes 1 Lethal Damage. Healing Aggravated Damage via Repairs requires 1 Pyros for each 1 point of Aggravated Damage. Marconi is not affected by Disquiet from Radioheart, but can be affected by Disquiet from other Prometheans. Marconi has General and Ballistic Armor equal to his Rank for free, but does not go into hibernation like a Spirit does when his Corpus is filled with Aggravated Damage, he is simply destroyed.<br /> <br /> The Digitalize Manifestation requires 1 Pyros and lets him exist as an intangible entity of information that can travel along digital networks. This lasts for hours equal to Successes on his Power + Finesse roll, and during each hour he simply inhabits an active digital device but does nothing except rest, he heals 1 Lethal Damage. During this period, he can be detected via suitable programs and might register as malware, but any mundane attempts to detect or remove him suffer a dice penalty equal to his Successes on his Power + Finesse roll, and supernatural attempts trigger a Clash Of Wills against his Resistance + Rank. The Collapsible Manifestation lets Marconi reflexively assume the form of any mundane digital device of up to Size 3 with an Equipment Bonus equal to his Rank, and he can spend Pyros to use his Influence over Computers on himself while in Collapsible Form.<br /> <br /> Quotes:<br /> \u200b</div> </div> </div> </div>That is an incredibly cool idea, a dedicated guide on a Promethean's Pilgrimage, a true friend that stands by them during the journey. Plus a very fun NPC to interact with.<br /> <br /> Personally, I think you post some incredibly creative and evocative content. From Legacies to organizations, Abyssal Manifestations to Ephemeral Entities, its always something unique and interesting. I really hope you stay motivated to continue, but am thankful for all you shared regardless.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-23T13:16:49-08:00","id":1503771,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1499112-entities-from-my-mage-chronicles?p=1503746#post1503746\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That is an incredibly cool idea, a dedicated guide on a Promethean's Pilgrimage, a true friend that stands by them during the journey. Plus a very fun NPC to interact with.<br /> <br /> Personally, I think you post some incredibly creative and evocative content. From Legacies to organizations, Abyssal Manifestations to Ephemeral Entities, its always something unique and interesting. I really hope you stay motivated to continue, but am thankful for all you shared regardless.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks, but I've decided to not post on these forums anymore. I'd say why, but I no longer have the energy to fool myself into believing in the lie that my explanations would make a difference for helping me solve the problems I'm facing. I'm gonna change my forum signature to let people know I'm not coming back to these forums, but am theoretically open to others reaching out to me elsewhere in an individual sense, if they respect me as a human being. But I'm probably asking for far too much. I'd love to be proven wrong, but I'm not going to have that kind of dream anymore.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-23T19:38:22-08:00","id":1503788,"title":"","content":"OK, I was having a bad episode when I made the previous post and jumped the gun. Sorry about that.<br /> <br /> I might post Zappy next, stay tuned.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-24T16:06:03-08:00","id":1503851,"title":"","content":"<b><a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/gJnOxM7.png\" target=\"_blank\">Zappy (Digital-Spirit)</a></b><br /> <br /> A Familiar of The Reptilian, a Thyrsus Mystagogue with a Metamorphic Awakening that transformed him into a chimerical crocodile, but who can still assume human form via Life Ruling. The Reptilian employed Zappy to monitor the Internet and its important Resonances inside Seattle, especially those pertaining to misinformation regarding the Wonders that the Making Science Cabal was inventing to share with Sleepers. Making Science had the shared goal of challenging the influence of local Pylons of Ministries such as Pantechnicon, Mammon and Panopticon, who sought to hijack scientific progress of humanity in the name their corresponding Exarchs.<br /> <br /> Rank: 2<br /> Attributes: Power 5, Finesse 5, Resistance 4<br /> Willpower: 9<br /> Essence: 15<br /> Initiative: 9<br /> Defense: 5<br /> Speed: 25 (Species Factor 15)<br /> Size: 2<br /> Corpus: 6<br /> Influences: Computers 2<br /> Ban 1: Must always change something about any information it shares<br /> Ban 2: Cannot harm those who regularly spread rumors via computers<br /> Bane: Rubber<br /> Manifestation: Twilight Form, Fetter, Image, Unfetter, Materialize<br /> Numina: Aggressive Meme, Blast (Electricity), Eye Spy (As Per The Dread Power), Occult Sight, Perfect Lie<br /> Other Traits: Price Of Power X 1<br /> <br /> Quotes:<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> A nearby and bird-like spirit of electricity reaches out to him by manipulating the images in an outdoors advertisement.<br /> <br /> &quot;OH BOY, OH BOY, A SHAMAN, A SHAMAN! WHAT IS GOOD, WHAT IS THE NEWS? I GOT SO MUCH STUFF I WANNA TALK ABOUT, YOU GOT A MINUTE?&quot;<br /> <br /> The Reptilian nods and smiles, offering his phone in both hands &quot;Take my ear, for a little while, sprite.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;OK OK OK, I HEARD ONE OF YOUR KIND IS PLANNING TO BUILD SOMETHING IN THIS CITY THAT WILL CHANNEL A LOT OF ELECTRICITY, AND MAYBE IT WILL INVOLVE LEY LINES TOO! MY CHOIR TELLS ME THAT IT IS SOMETHING BIG!&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;That's interesting. You know what would be a lot more interesting?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;TELLMETELLMETELLME!!!!!&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;If you helped me form a small pack, a select group to help me and mine invent something even better, more artful, and more difficult. Wouldn't that be wonderful to do right now?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;COUNT ME IN, LET'S MAKE IT ZAPPY!&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Okay, show me to the authority, whom would I negotiate a proper party with?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;OH, HE ISN'T HERE, HE STAYS ON THE OTHER SIDE OF THE GAUNTLET UNLESS SOMETHING REALLY IMPORTANT DEMANDS HIS ATTENTION. I CAN LEAD YOU TO HIM, BUT PLEEEEAAAAASE DON'T MAKE ME TALK TO HIM, HE IS VERY SCARY!&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I will speak to him, Sprite, you may live in my personal lightning speaker. If you'd like you can live under my grace indefinitely?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I WANT TO ZAP AROUND FREELY IF IT STRIKES MY FANCY, BUT SURE, WE CAN HANG OUT, NO PROBLEM!&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I think you will like the place I bring you. If you cooperate I could get you a superhighway of lightning and invention. Charge of flavor and power incomparable to the decaying splendor of human laboratories.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;YOU DRIVE A HARD BARGAIN. I LIKE IT! I'LL STICK AROUND FOR LONGER THEN. SEE WHAT YOU ARE ALL ABOUT.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Hard bargains, better benefits.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;OK, THE NEAREST GATEWAY INTO THE SHADOW IS FAR FROM THIS NEIGHBORHOOD. THE DENSITY OF URBANITY MAKES THE GAUNTLET REALLY STRONG IN THIS CITY. YOU'LL NEED TO GO INTO THE OUTSKIRTS.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I live out there, but I could also speak across it. Would the magistrate prefer my direct presence?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;EITHER WORKS, REALLY. BUT HE APPRECIATES IT WHEN HE GETS A DIRECT VISIT FROM A SHAMAN WHO CAN BEST HIM IN A LITTLE DUEL.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Ah, yes, direct visit it will be.&quot; <hr /><br /> &quot;Okay so, what else should I know here? &quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;HMMM. WELL, HE LIKES TO TELEPORT AROUND A LOT AND STICKS TO RANGED ATTACKS. ACTUALLY GETTING CLOSE ENOUGH TO HIT HIM WITHOUT GETTING FRIED FIRST MIGHT BE AN ISSUE? OH YEAH, HE HAS THE HOME TURF ADVANTAGE, TOO. I HEARD HE CAN CONTROL GRAVITY INSIDE HIS THRONE ROOM OR WHATEVER HE CALLS IT.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Neither is a problem. Will he talk first or skip straight to the fight?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;HE PROBABLY WON'T TALK FOR MORE THAN A MINUTE. BUT I RECOMMEND YOU LISTEN UNTIL HE IS DONE, HE TENDS TO GET PISSED OFF WHEN INTERRUPTED. AND WHEN HE IS PISSED OFF, HE GOES ALL OUT.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Well he'll end up doing that one way or another.&quot; Reptilian closes his eyes and begins speaking in the Speech<br /> <br /> The Reptilian spends the remaining time up to 30 minutes in powerful meditation, as he grows a bestial scaly war form and and girds himself in the essence, as lightning itself makes way for him, as his DNA asserts itself visibly in the essence in the code of obedience. He opens his eyes, themselves covered in a barely visible mystical scale layer. The spirit may or may not know he is seeing the mystical form of the shaman, and that it will continue manifesting over time.<br /> <br /> &quot;I am ready, Zappy, show me the way. And keep up.&quot;<br /> <br /> Zappy fidgets and shakes on your monstrous shoulder.<br /> <br /> &quot;A-A-A-ALRIGHT, BUT WHEN WE'RE CLOSE TO THE THRONE ROOM, I'M LEAVING! I ALREADY TOLD YOU ALL I KNOW, ANYWAY. AND HE'D DESTROY ME LIKE I'M NOTHING, SO IT'S NOT LIKE I WOULD BE USEFUL IN THE FIGHT.&quot;<br /> <br /> As you cross the Iris into the Shadow, your entire body is bathed in the tingling, electric sensation of the combined urban Resonances of Seattle. The sensation is brief, but not unlike being electrocuted while submerged in molten plastic.<br /> <br /> The spiritual reflection of the city reminds Reptilian of the descriptions Umbra gave him of the movies and music she based her Core Praxis on: futuristic chrome and neon, with elegant angles and curvature. The prevailing colors are white with highlights of electric blue, and there are occasional splashes of liquid TV-static pooling from the carcasses of the unfit spirits.<br /> <br /> All around, synthwave music plays in the background, though it has moral primal feel to it, like you are inside a coliseum-planet from some dystopian sci-fi story. As you approach the throne room, the architecture becomes increasingly jagged and erratic. You eventually reach a spiral staircase of holographic rectangles which lead to the top of a stylized corporate skyscraper. All around you, the crackling-hissing noise of electricity spirits is cacophonous and disorienting. Luna can be seen in the sky above, but it is best to not stare too much if you want to keep your sanity.<br /> <br /> Zappy leaves and wishes you good luck.<br /> <br /> The man that approaches is in stretched out flannels which are normally loose, shorts revealing spines and scaled muscles where normally smoother skin prevails, and the clawed and fanged form of a man who normally would carry token items of technology. Ironically, coming here, none of those things had made it, left in the car to be protected. Only the man was here now, a snout of distinctly ancient shape and keen eyes. He walks through the crackling, and tauntingly licks at the lightning, as it jumps away. &quot;I am here to speak with the Digital King, I come in the traditional way. Only I enter this place.&quot; He smiles, with the claws and fangs of the Seattle typewriter visible &quot;I offer peaceful and proving diplomacy freely, and wish to accommodate how you wish to hear me.&quot;<br /> <br /> Reptilian hears an awful, awful burst of various technological devices as Rex Silica approaches. Little metallic pebbles start to float due to the abnormal readings of electromagnetic fields. A thunderstorm manifests from nowhere and the lightning carries the sound of mad laughter. You blink, and he is now occupying his throne of multicolored wires and circuitry.<br /> <br /> Rex Silica, for some reason, appears to be wearing a human-ish guise. He resembles blue-skinned man with long, spidery limbs and a Mohawk of white plasma. He wears no clothes, though he lacks the finer details of human anatomy such as hair or genitals. His smile is... is that even something you can call a smile? On his back is a highly ornate electric guitar covered in Spirit Tongue terms that are all some variant of &quot;DREAD GOD&quot;.<br /> <br /> He seems very excited to see you.<br /> <br /> &quot;Aha, I see you're as handsome as me. I am The Reptilian, and I am pleased to introduce myself to you.&quot;\u200b </div> </div> </div>\u200b</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-26T12:08:10-08:00","id":1503958,"title":"","content":"Turns out the notes I had on this character were very vague, and he didn't really make an on-screen appearance. So I expanded him into a revised iteration.<br /> <br /> <b><a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/QziLUCi.png\" target=\"_blank\">Quincy Jones - Salakhiel, The Pardon Of God</a></b><br /> <br /> Quote: &quot;Across time and space, lost people are trying to find unreal homes for broken hearts. The symphony of the spheres grows quiet in anticipation of something grandiose, for better or worse.&quot;<br /> <br /> A Messenger Integrator+Tempter whose vision of Hell is &quot;Bring Our Heavenly Father Out Of His Coma So He Can Behold Our Greatest Work&quot;. He takes it as a matter of unhinged, ramshackle faith that the God-Machine must be benevolent, because if Quincy was made in His image and only wishes to help humanity, then by logical extension the God-Machine must be a force of benevolence if His works are seen from a cosmic perspective that accounts for all the relevant factors. However, Quincy has no intent of forcibly subjugating humanity in the name of Our Father. He believes Earth MUST become something that makes Our Father feel proud of us as a species, instead of just another failure to be relegated to the Apocalypse Vault. Humanity must choose salvation, otherwise Earth is but a scientific experiment with diminishing results and whose upkeep of human losses cannot be justified.<br /> <br /> Therefore, Quincy continues his Angelic mission of inspiring forgiveness between humans so they can stop warring and instead collaborate on turning Earth into the best possible approximation of Heaven. His central message is that cooperation is destined by God's will to triumph over subjugation, but God is in a coma and humanity is effectively on its own, and prone to repeating mistakes that are accumulating into a potential extinction. This means that Quincy is an alarmist and insecure person who seeks constant reaffirmation that there is still hope for mankind to forgive itself. Therefore, he has the Virtue of Merciful, but has the Vice of Doubtful. His Catalyst is Causality in the sense that he is spreading a message of his own, because he deep down suspects that maybe Our Father will never wake up from His coma, which means forgiveness must be kept alive in the hearts of mankind despite the final absence of God.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/zGXfhh0d43s\" data-code=\"zGXfhh0d43s\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/zGXfhh0d43s/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}